@@PART:head@@
    <b:comment>Youdle homepage: fonts, structured data and styles. Homepage view only.</b:comment>
    <b:if cond='data:view.isHomepage'>
      <link href='https://fonts.gstatic.com' rel='preconnect' crossorigin='anonymous'/>
      <link href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,600;6..72,700&amp;display=swap' rel='stylesheet'/>
      <meta content='#173e2f' name='theme-color'/>
      <b:comment>Blogger emits title, description and Open Graph from Settings; Twitter Card tags it does not.</b:comment>
      <meta content='summary_large_image' name='twitter:card'/>
      <meta expr:content='data:blog.title' name='twitter:title'/>
      <meta content='{{site.definition}}' name='twitter:description'/>
      <meta content='{{seo.twitter_site}}' name='twitter:site'/>
      <meta content='{{seo.logo_url}}' name='twitter:image'/>
      <script type='application/ld+json'>{{raw jsonld_org}}</script>
      <script type='application/ld+json'>{{raw jsonld_site}}</script>
      <style type='text/css'>{{raw css}}</style>
    </b:if>

@@PART:header@@
    <b:if cond='data:view.isHomepage'>
      <header class='yd-header' role='banner'>
        <div class='yd-container yd-header__inner'>
          <b:comment>Handoff link map: Logo / Home goes to the main Youdle site.</b:comment>
          <a class='yd-header__brand' href='{{urls.home}}'>
            {{raw logo_svg}}
            <span class='yd-visually-hidden'>Youdle home</span>
          </a>

          <nav aria-label='Primary' class='yd-nav'>
            <a aria-current='page' class='yd-nav__link' expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl'>Grocery Today</a>
            <a class='yd-nav__link' data-yd-event='nav_community_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_header' href='{{urls.community}}'>Community</a>
            <a class='yd-nav__link' data-yd-event='nav_grocery_list_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_header' href='{{urls.grocery_list}}'>Grocery List</a>
          </nav>

          <div class='yd-header__actions'>
            <a class='yd-btn yd-btn--primary yd-header__cta' data-yd-event='newsletter_cta_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_header' data-yd-scroll-to-signup='true' href='#the-youdle-brief'>
              <span class='yd-header__cta-long'>Subscribe to The Youdle Brief</span>
              <span class='yd-header__cta-short'>Subscribe</span>
            </a>
            <b:comment>
              Button and menu share a positioning context so the dropdown hangs
              directly beneath the button. Anchoring to the header instead put
              it against the viewport edge, well right of the button on wide
              screens.
            </b:comment>
            <div class='yd-menu'>
              <button aria-controls='yd-menu' aria-expanded='false' class='yd-menu-toggle' data-yd-menu-toggle='true' type='button'>
                <span class='yd-visually-hidden'>Menu</span>
                <svg aria-hidden='true' class='yd-menu-toggle__open' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-width='2' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M3.5 7h17'/><path d='M3.5 12h17'/><path d='M3.5 17h17'/></svg>
                <svg aria-hidden='true' class='yd-menu-toggle__close' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-width='2' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M5.5 5.5l13 13'/><path d='M18.5 5.5l-13 13'/></svg>
              </button>

              <nav aria-label='More' class='yd-drawer' data-yd-menu='true' hidden='hidden' id='yd-menu'>
                <div class='yd-drawer__group'>
                  <h2 class='yd-drawer__label' id='yd-menu-explore'>Explore</h2>
                  <ul aria-labelledby='yd-menu-explore'>
                    <li><a expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl'>Grocery Today</a></li>
                    <li><a href='{{urls.community}}'>Community</a></li>
                    <li><a href='{{urls.grocery_list}}'>Grocery List</a></li>
                    <b:comment>
                      The stock homepage reached the full archive through its
                      sidebar drawer; keep that path open from the new menu.
                    </b:comment>
                    <li><a expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl + &quot;search&quot;'>All stories</a></li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div class='yd-drawer__group'>
                  <h2 class='yd-drawer__label' id='yd-menu-company'>Company</h2>
                  <ul aria-labelledby='yd-menu-company'>
                    <li><a href='{{urls.about}}'>About Youdle</a></li>
                    <li><a href='{{urls.contact}}' rel='noopener' target='_blank'>Contact</a></li>
                    <li><a href='{{urls.advertise}}'>Advertise With Us</a></li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </nav>
              <b:comment>
                Below 900px the desktop nav is hidden and this menu is the only
                route to the other sections, so with no scripting it simply
                renders open, in the same place the toggle would put it.
              </b:comment>
              <noscript>
                <style type='text/css'>.yd-drawer[hidden]{display:block}</style>
              </noscript>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>
    </b:if>

@@PART:main@@
  <b:comment>
    Sections 02 to 06 of the homepage. This lives inside the Blog1 widget
    because it is the only scope where data:posts is available. The stock
    theme wrapper chain around it is flattened by CSS scoped to
    body.homepage-view.
  </b:comment>

  <b:comment>02 Hero</b:comment>
  <section class='yd-hero' aria-labelledby='yd-hero-title'>
    <div class='yd-container yd-hero__inner'>
      <div class='yd-hero__copy'>
        <p class='yd-eyebrow yd-hero__eyebrow'>Real grocery info. Real shoppers. Real help.</p>
        <h1 class='yd-hero__title' id='yd-hero-title'>See this before your next <span class='yd-underline'>grocery run.<svg aria-hidden='true' class='yd-underline__stroke' focusable='false' preserveAspectRatio='none' viewBox='0 0 320 20' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M5 14.2C88 5.6 208 2.9 315 7.9' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-width='7'/></svg></span></h1>
        <p class='yd-hero__lede'>Recalls, price drops, new finds, and the grocery stories people are talking about.</p>
        <div class='yd-hero__actions'>
          <b:comment>
            The handoff routes this to Grocery Today, which on this site IS this
            page. Adapted to an in-page jump to the story row rather than a
            reload; see README "Decisions that need your sign-off".
          </b:comment>
          <a class='yd-btn yd-btn--primary' data-yd-event='hero_news_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_hero' href='#yd-stories'>
            See What’s Happening
            <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-width='1.7' viewBox='0 0 16 16' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M2.5 8h11'/><path d='M9 3.5 13.5 8 9 12.5'/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class='yd-btn yd-btn--ghost' data-yd-event='hero_community_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_hero' href='{{urls.community}}'>Join the Community</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='yd-hero__media'>
        <div class='yd-hero__figure'>
{{#if images.hero}}
          <b:comment>
            width/height describe the shipped placeholder crop. They only hint
            the intrinsic ratio - the figure controls the box, so nothing
            shifts - but update them alongside the production photograph.
          </b:comment>
          <img alt='{{images.hero_alt}}' fetchpriority='high' height='450' src='{{images.hero}}' width='554'/>
{{else}}
          <p aria-hidden='true' class='yd-media-fallback'>Real info.<br/>Real shoppers.<br/>Real help.</p>
{{/if}}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <b:comment>
    03 What Everyone’s Talking About.
    The whole section is gated on there being posts: a heading over empty space
    reads as broken, and "View all stories" has nothing to point at.
  </b:comment>
  <b:if cond='data:posts.any'>
    <section class='yd-stories' aria-labelledby='yd-stories-title' id='yd-stories'>
    <div class='yd-container'>
      <h2 class='yd-eyebrow yd-stories__heading' id='yd-stories-title'>What everyone’s talking about</h2>

      <b:if cond='data:posts.any'>
        <div class='yd-stories__grid'>
          <b:loop index='i' values='data:posts' var='post'>
            <b:if cond='data:i &lt; 3'>
              <article class='yd-story'>
                <div class='yd-story__media'>
                  <b:if cond='data:post.featuredImage'>
                    <b:comment>
                      alt is empty on purpose: the headline is announced right
                      after and is the link, so a description here would just
                      repeat it. srcset is only meaningful for Google-hosted
                      images; the live blog also uses i.ibb.co, which Blogger
                      cannot resize, and an empty srcset falls back to src.
                    </b:comment>
                    <img alt='' class='yd-story__img' expr:src='data:post.featuredImage.isResizable ? resizeImage(data:post.featuredImage, 800, &quot;16:7&quot;) : data:post.featuredImage' expr:srcset='data:post.featuredImage.isResizable ? resizeImage(data:post.featuredImage, 400, &quot;16:7&quot;) + &quot; 400w, &quot; + resizeImage(data:post.featuredImage, 800, &quot;16:7&quot;) + &quot; 800w&quot; : &quot;&quot;' height='350' loading='lazy' sizes='(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 900px) 50vw, 380px' width='800'/>
                  <b:else/>
                    <p aria-hidden='true' class='yd-media-fallback'>Grocery Today</p>
                  </b:if>

                  <b:comment>
                    The live blog stores raw pipeline constants as labels
                    (SHOPPERS, RECALL, GROCERS...). Map them to the reader-facing
                    category names from the approved comp; anything unmapped
                    falls through to the label as written.
                  </b:comment>
                  <b:if cond='data:post.labels'>
                    <b:with value='data:post.labels.first.name' var='ydLabel'>
                      <span class='yd-story__chip'>
                        <b:if cond='data:ydLabel in {&quot;RECALL&quot;, &quot;recall&quot;, &quot;Recall&quot;, &quot;consumer warning&quot;}'>Recalls &amp; Warnings
                        <b:elseif cond='data:ydLabel in {&quot;deals&quot;, &quot;Deals&quot;, &quot;DEALS&quot;}'/>Prices &amp; Deals
                        <b:elseif cond='data:ydLabel in {&quot;SHOPPERS&quot;, &quot;shoppers&quot;, &quot;Shoppers&quot;}'/>Grocery News
                        <b:elseif cond='data:ydLabel in {&quot;GROCERS&quot;, &quot;grocers&quot;}'/>For Grocers
                        <b:elseif cond='data:ydLabel in {&quot;EMERGENCY&quot;, &quot;emergency&quot;}'/>Emergency Prep
                        <b:else/><data:ydLabel/>
                        </b:if>
                      </span>
                    </b:with>
                  </b:if>
                </div>

                <div class='yd-story__body'>
                  <p class='yd-story__meta'>
                    <time expr:datetime='data:post.date.iso8601'><b:eval expr='format(data:post.date, &quot;MMMM d, YYYY&quot;)'/></time>
                  </p>
                  <h3 class='yd-story__title'>
                    <a data-yd-event='homepage_story_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_stories' expr:href='data:post.url'><data:post.title/></a>
                  </h3>
                  <p class='yd-story__dek'><b:eval expr='snippet(data:post.snippets.long, { length: 132, links: false, linebreaks: false, ellipsis: true })'/></p>
                </div>
              </article>
            </b:if>
          </b:loop>
        </div>

        <b:comment>GEO: ItemList for the three previews. Article schema stays on the article pages.</b:comment>
        <script type='application/ld+json'>{&quot;@context&quot;:&quot;https://schema.org&quot;,&quot;@type&quot;:&quot;ItemList&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;What everyone is talking about&quot;,&quot;itemListElement&quot;:[<b:loop index='i' values='data:posts' var='post'><b:if cond='data:i &lt; 3'><b:if cond='data:i != 0'>,</b:if>{&quot;@type&quot;:&quot;ListItem&quot;,&quot;position&quot;:<b:eval expr='data:i + 1'/>,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;<b:eval expr='data:post.url.canonical.jsonEscaped'/>&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;<b:eval expr='data:post.title.jsonEscaped'/>&quot;}</b:if></b:loop>]}</script>
      </b:if>

      <div class='yd-stories__more'>
        <b:comment>
          Blogger's /search with no query is the full reverse-chronological post
          list with paging - the only real "all stories" archive this blog has.
        </b:comment>
        <a class='yd-textlink' data-yd-event='view_all_stories_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_stories' expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl + &quot;search&quot;'>
          View all stories
          <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-width='1.7' viewBox='0 0 16 16' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M2.5 8h11'/><path d='M9 3.5 13.5 8 9 12.5'/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    </section>
  </b:if>

  <b:comment>04 Community Preview</b:comment>
  <section class='yd-community' aria-labelledby='yd-community-title'>
    <div class='yd-container'>
      <div class='yd-community__panel'>
        <div class='yd-community__copy'>
          <p class='yd-eyebrow yd-community__eyebrow'>Real shoppers. Real conversations.</p>
          <h2 class='yd-community__title' id='yd-community-title'>See what shoppers are finding.</h2>
          <p class='yd-community__lede'>Deals, price changes, new products, and what’s happening in stores.</p>
          <a class='yd-btn yd-btn--primary' data-yd-event='community_cta_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_community' href='{{urls.community}}'>
            Join the Community
            <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-width='1.7' viewBox='0 0 16 16' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M2.5 8h11'/><path d='M9 3.5 13.5 8 9 12.5'/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class='yd-community__feed'>
          <b:comment>Preview content. Handoff link map: no required link for V1.</b:comment>
          <ul class='yd-community__cards'>
{{#each community_posts}}
            <li class='yd-post'>
              <div class='yd-post__media'>
{{#if item.image}}
                <img alt='{{item.image_alt}}' height='200' loading='lazy' src='{{item.image}}' width='300'/>
{{else}}
                <p aria-hidden='true' class='yd-media-fallback'>Shopper find</p>
{{/if}}
              </div>
              <div class='yd-post__body'>
                <div class='yd-post__head'>
                  <span aria-hidden='true' class='yd-post__avatar'>{{item.initials}}</span>
                  <span class='yd-post__author'>{{item.author}}</span>
                  <span class='yd-post__time'>{{item.time}}<span class='yd-visually-hidden'> ago</span></span>
                </div>
                <p class='yd-post__text'>{{item.text}}</p>
                <p class='yd-post__likes'>
                  <svg aria-hidden='true' focusable='false' viewBox='0 0 16 16' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M8 14.2 2.9 9.3A3.4 3.4 0 0 1 8 4.8a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 5.1 4.5z' fill='currentColor'/></svg>
                  {{item.likes}}
                  <span class='yd-visually-hidden'>likes</span>
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
{{/each}}
          </ul>

          <div class='yd-community__more'>
            <a class='yd-textlink' data-yd-event='community_cta_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_community_feed' href='{{urls.community}}'>
              Go to Community
              <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-width='1.7' viewBox='0 0 16 16' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M2.5 8h11'/><path d='M9 3.5 13.5 8 9 12.5'/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <b:comment>05 Grocery List</b:comment>
  <section class='yd-grocery' aria-labelledby='yd-grocery-title'>
    <div class='yd-container'>
      <div class='yd-grocery__panel'>
        <div class='yd-grocery__copy'>
          <p class='yd-eyebrow yd-grocery__eyebrow'>Shop smarter</p>
          <h2 class='yd-grocery__title' id='yd-grocery-title'>Your Grocery List, anywhere.</h2>
          <p class='yd-grocery__lede'>Build it. Share it. Take it with you.</p>
          <a class='yd-btn yd-btn--ghost' data-yd-event='grocery_list_click' data-yd-placement='homepage_grocery_list' href='{{urls.grocery_list}}'>
            Go to Grocery List
            <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-width='1.7' viewBox='0 0 16 16' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M2.5 8h11'/><path d='M9 3.5 13.5 8 9 12.5'/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class='yd-grocery__visual'>
          <b:comment>Phone mock is real markup, not an image, so the list text stays crawlable.</b:comment>
          <div aria-hidden='true' class='yd-phone'>
            <div class='yd-phone__screen'>
              <div class='yd-phone__statusbar'>
                <svg fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-width='2.4' viewBox='0 0 16 16' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M10 3 5 8l5 5'/></svg>
                <span>9:41</span>
              </div>
              <div class='yd-phone__titlebar'>
                <span class='yd-phone__title'>My Grocery List</span>
                <span class='yd-phone__grip'><i/><i/><i/><i/><i/><i/><i/><i/><i/></span>
              </div>
              <ul class='yd-phone__list'>
                <li class='yd-phone__item'><span class='yd-phone__box'/>Milk</li>
                <li class='yd-phone__item'><span class='yd-phone__box'/>Eggs</li>
                <li class='yd-phone__item'><span class='yd-phone__box'/>Bread</li>
                <li class='yd-phone__item'><span class='yd-phone__box'/>Bananas</li>
                <li class='yd-phone__item'><span class='yd-phone__box'/>Spinach</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='yd-grocery__illus'>
{{#if images.grocery}}
            <img alt='{{images.grocery_alt}}' height='580' loading='lazy' src='{{images.grocery}}' width='780'/>
{{else}}
            <p aria-hidden='true' class='yd-media-fallback'>Build it. Share it.<br/>Take it with you.</p>
{{/if}}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <b:comment>06 The Youdle Brief</b:comment>
  <section class='yd-brief' aria-labelledby='yd-brief-title' id='the-youdle-brief'>
    <div class='yd-container'>
      <div class='yd-brief__panel'>
        <div class='yd-brief__copy'>
          <span class='yd-brief__icon'>
            <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-width='1.5' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect height='14' rx='2' width='19' x='2.5' y='5'/><path d='m3 6.5 9 6.5 9-6.5'/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h2 class='yd-brief__title' id='yd-brief-title'><span>Don’t miss what matters.</span> <span>Get The Youdle Brief.</span></h2>
            <p class='yd-brief__lede'>The grocery stories worth knowing, delivered to your inbox.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='yd-brief__form-wrap'>
          <b:comment>
            Existing Mailchimp list. JS upgrades this to the JSONP endpoint for
            inline success and error states; with JS off it posts normally.
          </b:comment>
          <form action='{{newsletter.action}}' class='yd-brief__form' data-yd-newsletter='true' method='post' name='yd-brief-form' target='_blank'>
            <div>
              <label class='yd-visually-hidden yd-brief__label' for='yd-brief-email'>Email address</label>
              <input aria-describedby='yd-brief-status' autocomplete='email' class='yd-brief__input' id='yd-brief-email' name='EMAIL' placeholder='Enter your email' required='required' type='email'/>
            </div>
            <button class='yd-btn yd-btn--cream yd-brief__submit' data-yd-newsletter-submit='true' name='subscribe' type='submit'>Sign me up</button>
            <div aria-hidden='true' class='yd-brief__hp'>
              <input name='{{newsletter.honeypot_name}}' tabindex='-1' type='text' value=''/>
            </div>
          </form>
          <p aria-live='polite' class='yd-brief__status' data-yd-newsletter-status='true' id='yd-brief-status' role='status'/>
          <p class='yd-brief__fine'>It’s free and you can unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

@@PART:footer@@
    <b:if cond='data:view.isHomepage'>
      <footer class='yd-footer' role='contentinfo'>
        <div class='yd-container'>
          <div class='yd-footer__top'>
            <div class='yd-footer__about-col'>
              <b:comment>AEO: a plain-language definition of Youdle in crawlable text.</b:comment>
              <p class='yd-footer__about'>{{site.footer_about}}</p>
              <p class='yd-footer__definition'>{{site.definition}}</p>
              <div class='yd-social'>
                <a href='{{urls.facebook}}' rel='noopener' target='_blank'>
                  <span class='yd-visually-hidden'>Youdle on Facebook</span>
                  <svg aria-hidden='true' focusable='false' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-1.6 19.9v-7h-2.5V12h2.5V9.8c0-2.5 1.5-3.9 3.7-3.9 1.1 0 2.2.2 2.2.2v2.4h-1.2c-1.2 0-1.6.8-1.6 1.6V12h2.7l-.4 2.9h-2.3v7A10 10 0 0 0 12 2z' fill='currentColor'/></svg>
                </a>
                <a href='{{urls.instagram}}' rel='noopener' target='_blank'>
                  <span class='yd-visually-hidden'>Youdle on Instagram</span>
                  <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.9' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect height='18' rx='5' width='18' x='3' y='3'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='4'/><circle cx='17.4' cy='6.6' fill='currentColor' r='1.2' stroke='none'/></svg>
                </a>
                <a href='{{urls.tiktok}}' rel='noopener' target='_blank'>
                  <span class='yd-visually-hidden'>Youdle on TikTok</span>
                  <svg aria-hidden='true' focusable='false' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M16.5 2h-2.9v13.1a2.6 2.6 0 1 1-2.6-2.6c.3 0 .5 0 .8.1V9.6a5.6 5.6 0 1 0 4.7 5.5V8.7a6.6 6.6 0 0 0 3.9 1.3V7a3.9 3.9 0 0 1-3.9-3.9V2z' fill='currentColor'/></svg>
                </a>
                <a href='{{urls.email}}'>
                  <span class='yd-visually-hidden'>Email Youdle</span>
                  <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' focusable='false' stroke='currentColor' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-width='1.8' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect height='14' rx='2' width='18' x='3' y='5'/><path d='m3.5 6.5 8.5 6 8.5-6'/></svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h2 class='yd-footer__colhead'>Explore</h2>
              <ul class='yd-footer__list'>
                <li><a expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl'>Grocery Today</a></li>
                <li><a href='{{urls.community}}'>Community</a></li>
                <li><a href='{{urls.grocery_list}}'>Grocery List</a></li>
              </ul>
